source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Messages about devices, your account and news.

Usage: hn messages [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  read     Mark messages as read
  unread   Mark messages as unread
  archive  Move messages out of the inbox
  restore  Bring archived messages back

Options:
      --unread  Only unread messages
  -h, --help    Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn messages --unread
  hn messages read <id> <id>
  hn messages read --all
  hn messages archive <id>
